{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14211130","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14211130","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1421113001:1":{"text":"고, 고맙습니다! 덕분에 살았어요!","source_cn":"谢、谢谢你们，多亏了你们救了我一命！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x033167333AE77606","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1421113001":{"text":"고, 고맙습니다! 덕분에 살았어요!","source_cn":"谢、谢谢你们，多亏了你们救了我一命！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x033167333AE77606","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421113002:1":{"text":"헤헤, 어떻게 아셨죠? 설마 이 핀로의 이름이 벌써 셀로클랜드에 알려진 건가요?!","source_cn":"嘿嘿，你们怎么知道？莫非我芬洛的大名已经传遍了萨洛克兰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D15DD549EA57EE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421113003:1":{"text":"...당신이 핀로였군요? 사냥을 오면서 무기도 안 가져오면 어떡해요?","source_cn":"……原来你就是芬洛。出来打猎，怎么也不带上武器？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AD7375F8CCAD6F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421113004:1":{"text":"저, 저는 인듀어처럼 강하지도 않은데 사냥을 할 리가 없잖아요?!","source_cn":"我、我又不是因度厄那样的高手，哪敢打猎啊？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69C02B72B770F2E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421113005:1":{"text":"그냥 독 없는 솜털 버섯이나 좀 따면서 물고기나 잡을 생각이었어요. 그런데 갑자기 버섯 몬스터를 만나는 바람에...","source_cn":"我只是出来摘点无毒的茸茸伞菇顺便钓几条鱼，没想到就碰上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB19F76B1F23DD17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1421113006:1":{"text":"제가 그나마 발이 빨라 어떻게든 피해 다녔지, 안 그랬으면 이틀 전에 벌써 잡아먹혔을걸요...","source_cn":"要不是我跑得还算快，跟它周旋了一阵子，估计前两天就被吃了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBC5198921FDE925","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1421113006":{"text":"제가 그나마 발이 빨라 어떻게든 피해 다녔지, 안 그랬으면 이틀 전에 벌써 잡아먹혔을걸요...","source_cn":"要不是我跑得还算快，跟它周旋了一阵子，估计前两天就被吃了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBC5198921FDE925","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1421113007:1":{"text":"음, 좀 잃어버렸고요. 도망치다가 먹기도 했죠. 그래서 다시 구해야 해요...","source_cn":"唉，丢了一些，逃命的时候吃了一些，如今又得从头开始……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE028DF7A27CD35E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1421113008:1":{"text":"시레이, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님! 핀로 씨를 도와주는 게 어떨까요?","source_cn":"席蕾，<style=stress><player_na...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE0A6A9FD7C4A65F9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"시레이, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님! 핀로 씨를 도와주는 게 어떨까요?","female":"시레이, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님! 핀로 씨를 도와주는 게 어떨까요?","variant_male_record_index":"162703","variant_female_record_index":"162704","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1421113009:1":{"text":"평범한 버섯을 따다가 목숨을 잃을 수 있다니, 상상도 못 했어요.","source_cn":"我从来没想过，采摘最普通的蘑菇，也有可能会遭遇性命之危。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CCD536F376B875A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1421113010:1":{"text":"인듀어 님도 어린 시절에 이런 일을 겪으셨을까요? 아니면 대부분의 평민들이 이런 일상을 겪는 걸까요...","source_cn":"这就是因度厄大人少年时的生活吗，还是大部分平民的日常呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x529BC12C35C7A370","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1421113011:1":{"text":"아마 후자일 거야. 그러니까 우리도 직접 체험해보자. 어쩌면 좋은 이야기를 쓰는 데 도움이 될 지도 몰라.","source_cn":"我想，应该是后者。所以，我们去体验一下吧——这样，也有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD40E2112EED1EF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1421113012:1":{"text":"그럼 먼저 솜털 버섯을 구하고 낚시를 하는 걸로 하자!","source_cn":"就这么说定了，先去采茸茸伞菇，再去钓鱼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD9EB63F090C8472","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1421113013:1":{"text":"낚시까지 해주신다고요? 이거 너무 신세를 지는 것 같은데요...","source_cn":"还要钓鱼吗？那怎么好意思……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x067997797734A6A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1421113014:1":{"text":"핀로 씨는 밖에서 며칠 씩이나 계셨으니, 넉넉하게 드시는 게 좋을 거 같아요.","source_cn":"芬洛先生困在野外好几天了，多吃点食物准没错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1428816560756717","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1421113015:1":{"text":"그... 그럼 부탁드릴게요! 저는 여기서 여러분이 돌아오실 때까지 쉬고 있을게요.","source_cn":"那……那就多谢你们了！我……我先在这休息下，等你们回来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6F64C9EB60D804D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"그래서, 구한 음식은?","source_cn":"那你摘的食物呢？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x720B39DFB15CC5DD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그래서, 구한 음식은?","female":"그래서, 구한 음식은?","variant_male_record_index":"72326","variant_female_record_index":"72327","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"혹시 네가 핀로야?","source_cn":"你是芬洛吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2B6A59ECB085283A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"혹시 네가 핀로야?","female":"혹시 네가 핀로야?","variant_male_record_index":"72324","variant_female_record_index":"72325","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:芬洛":{"text":"핀로","s